/E (In July 2026, geographic traffic shifted significantly as the Philippines surpassed the United States as the top market for volume, while total overall engagement contracted. In the Philippines, Site sessions grew from 61 to 84 \(+37.7%\) and Page views increased from 134 to 165 \(+23.1%\), despite Unique visitors cutting in half from 26 to 13 \(-50.0%\). Conversely, the United States saw marked declines across all key metrics, with Site sessions dropping from 86 to 59 \(-31.4%\), Unique visitors falling from 72 to 55 \(-23.6%\), and Page views nearly halving from 201 to 106 \(-47.3%\). Among smaller markets, the United Arab Emirates showed strong growth, with Site sessions edging up from 5 to 6 \(+20.0%\) and Page views surging from 11 to 30 \(+172.7%\).)
